        "title": "How you get in",
        "body": "Class 12 with Physics, Chemistry and Biology (and English). Entry varies by state: some use NEET-UG scores, others a state or university entrance test. AIIMS runs its own entrance for B.Sc (Hons) Nursing."
      }
